{"title":"TikTok's cooked","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/tiktok-s-cooked","date":1736530599000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you wait to find out if TikTok gets banned.</i></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/334ba2d3-3458-4a51-be96-88fa3659694d/Screenshot_2025-01-10_at_12.23.07_PM.png?t=1736529801\" /><div><span><p>(<a href=\"https://www.newgrounds.com/portal/view/960452?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">newgrounds.com</a>)</p></span></div></div><p>This week, Meta <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/meta-immigration-gender-policies-change/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">officially made it OK </a>to hurl abuse and slurs at any marginalized group you want. The best spin they have is “<a href=\"https://www.platformer.news/meta-new-trans-guidelines-hate-speech/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked#:~:text=Alex%20Schultz%2C%20the%20company%E2%80%99s%20chief%20marketing%20officer%20and%20highest%2Dranking%20gay%20executive%2C%20suggested%20in%20an%20internal%20post%20that%20people%20seeing%20their%20queer%20friends%20and%20family%20members%20abused%20on%20Facebook%20and%20Instagram%20could%20lead%20to%20increased%20support%20for%20LGBTQ%20rights.\" target=\"_blank\">all the abuse will be inspiring somehow</a>.” At least queer employees might <a href=\"https://www.404media.co/its-total-chaos-internally-at-meta-right-now-employees-protest-zuckerbergs-anti-lgbtq-changes/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">get some sick leave</a> out of it! The list of things Meta has stopped caring about also includes <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/new-documents-unredacted-meta-copyright-ai-lawsuit/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">copyright law</a> and <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2025/1/8/24339385/instagram-threads-politics-moderation-adam-mosseri?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">political neutrality</a>. Next to go might be one of its biggest rivals, since as we write this, the US Supreme Court is <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/live/tiktok-scotus-live-coverage/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">hearing TikTok’s final argument</a> to avoid a US ban. Without TikTok, Americans’ new favorite app will probably be wildfire-tracking platform <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/watch-duty-california-wildfires-ceo-founder-interview/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">Watch Duty</a>.</p><p>Oh well, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/Jonathan_Blow/status/1876748466908787124?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">An X post that might crash your browser if you click on it</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/maykitz/772208058041581568/customer-was-a-shitlib-and-treatlerite-one-night?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">Good post</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/oddlysatisfying/comments/1hutxaq/the_process_procedure_of_a_penny_floor/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">Penny floor</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/63grussell63/status/1875317312963932254?s=12&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">A good winter break project</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.newgrounds.com/portal/view/960452?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\"><i>DOOM: The Gallery Experience</i></a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/leyawn.bsky.social/post/3lf6477lvu22c?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">A good take on New York City congestion pricing</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/smegmafactory4ever/771224835424649216?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">Soup board</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/OkBuddyFresca/comments/1hop98k/jim_parsons_old_sheldon_would_make_a_convincing/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">“Jim Parsons (Old Sheldon) would make a convincing Homelander imo”</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/smilingnodding.bsky.social/post/3lehiscw3oc2y?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\" target=\"_blank\">A good post</a></p></li></ul><div><hr /><div><h2> Subscribe to Premium to read the rest. </h2><p> Become a paying subscriber of Premium to get access to this post and other subscriber-only content. </p><p><a href=\"https://www.garbageday.email/upgrade?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\">Upgrade</a> Translation missing: en.app.shared.conjuction.or <a href=\"https://www.garbageday.email/login?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-s-cooked\">Sign In</a></p><div><div><h3> A subscription gets you </h3></div><ul><li> Paywalled weekend issue </li><